[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the\nramp.</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238046\">3310B48</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Undo the bolts and move the rear brake\ndisc guard sideways.</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and disconnect the rear suspension longitudinal\ntie rod (1b) from the stub axle.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070029.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>1. Remove the bush (1a) using the tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Puller/ftitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.871.002.800</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070030.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place a new bush (1a) in the housing using the tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Puller/ftitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.871.002.800</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070031.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>1. Connect the rear suspension longitudinal tie rod (1a) to the\nstub axle and tighten the bolt (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR ANCHORAGE ROD</p></td><td><p>M12</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Wheel hub stub axle side) 11.7 ÷ 12.9</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070032.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>Place the rear brake disc guard\nback in its housing and fix it using the bolts.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238046\">3310B48</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]